  "details": "Please add all Inventory related content into a new category in the main Action Menu page, between \"Tools\" and \"Emoji & Stickers\" (in other words: move the seasonal and custom stickers/emojis into the Inventory category, and leave the default emojis category untouched)\n\nIt would be a future-proof category for all Inventory things VRChat may add in the future\n\nWhy am i making this suggestion:\n\nThe emoji menu is chaotic at the moment, it now takes 4 clicks to get into the Emoji category i want, and for me, someone who can't afford VRC+, all the content from Custom Stickers & Emoji are irrelevant, and it's just annoying to have to click so many times to just send a simple Emoji (which sometimes i want to send quickly, and now it's even worse with the one more click the Open Beta just added)",
